<!--
  The status-bar icon.

  A flat white silhouette on transparent, because Android 5+ treats a
  notification icon as a mask: every non-transparent pixel is painted with the
  system's tint, so a full-colour launcher icon arrives as a solid white
  square. A lorry, drawn in the one shape that survives that.

  Vector rather than a set of PNG densities: one file, sharp on every screen,
  and nothing to regenerate when it changes.
-->
